From 6c9b59cc34f62b738379b699f5800afebeff3ca4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 20:36:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 211/270] arm: add a driver for the ADT7461 temperature sensor
 of the AC100

The sensor shares the DVC I2C bus with the power management IC, which
the kernel drives for the clock, so the kernel now offers reads and
writes on that bus to drivers. /dev/sensor/adt7461 reads the
temperatures of the Tegra 2 and of the board as text.

Signed-off-by: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
